configure terminal
wlan-config 3 ornek-ssid-local
 tunnel local
wlan-config 4 ornek-ssid-tunnel
 tunnel remote
wlansec 3
 security rsn enable
 security rsn ciphers aes enable
 security rsn akm psk enable
 security rsn akm psk set-key ascii Sifreniz123
wlansec 4
 security rsn enable
 security rsn ciphers aes enable
 security rsn akm psk enable
 security rsn akm psk set-key ascii Sifreniz123
ap-group default
 interface-mapping 3 400 radio 1 ap-wlan-id 3
 interface-mapping 3 400 radio 2 ap-wlan-id 3
 interface-mapping 4 400 radio 1 ap-wlan-id 4
 interface-mapping 4 400 radio 2 ap-wlan-id 4
end
